{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7664457870012729619","title":"海外广告投放管培生-2027校招","description":"1、根据国内外市场团队需求，制定策略并实施广告投放活动；\n2、以数据为导向搭建与执行广告结构、广告预算、广告优化的落地，对整体广告投入产出比结果负责；\n3、根据业务需求完善目标用户画像，配合业务需求进行精准引流；\n4、结合AI工具的使用提升投广素材质量、产出效率及投放效率，根据表现迭代和优化广告素材，输出创意洞察；\n5、以数据为导向输出投广业务观察和深度评价，验证投广效果，提高业绩表现；\n6、撬动内外部资源与协作方，支持核心项目的推进和落地。","requirement":"1、本科以上学历；\n2、甲方/乙方媒介投放经验，熟悉Google平台优先（甲乙方均可）；\n3、代理商对接经验（优先）；\n4、掌握系统性广告投放方法论、营销归因，熟练掌握数据分析，数据驱动意识强；\n5、对设计、美学、创意有一定的见解，具备内容产出质量的判断能力，关注社交媒体和消费者市场；\n6、具备优秀的中英文沟通能力；尊重流程，有良好的工作习惯。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784521203148,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7664457870012582163","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}